{
  "_SETUP": "Before first run: place the Zenodo address datasets under data/ (https://zenodo.org/records/20841898), set systems.holoclean.db_* and HOLOCLEAN_DB_PWD env var, set systems.glocks.api_key_env, and install the Horizon commons-collections4-4.3.jar into baselines/horizon/. See experiments/README.md.",
  "paths": {
    "baselines_dir": "../baselines",
